      <p>Photographs of missing children. The Inter-national Center for Missing &amp; Exploited Children (ICMEC) provides resources for missing children. If you have information about a missing child, please contact ICMEC. You can find more information on their website. You can also contact the National Center for Missing &amp; Exploited Children at 1-800-THE-LOST (1-800-843-5678) if you recognize a child.</p>
