    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <h2 class="section-title">Activities That Are Not Passive</h2>
      <p>The following activities are not passive activities:</p>
      <ul class="list-item">
        <li>Trade or business activities in which you materially participate.</li>
        <li>Qualified rental activities.</li>
        <li>Real estate professional activities.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For more information, see Publication 563.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 class="section-title">Material Participation Tests</h2>
      <p>You materially participate in an activity if you meet any one of the following tests:</p>
      <ol>
        <li class="list-item">You participate in the activity for more than 500 hours during the tax year.</li>
        <li class="list-item">You participate in the activity for substantially all the activity during the tax year.</li>
        <li class="list-item">You participate in the activity for more than 100 hours during the tax year, and you are the individual who participates most in the activity during the tax year.</li>
        <li class="list-item">You participate in the activity for more than 50% of the total participation in the activity during the tax year.</li>
        <li class="list-item">You participate in the activity for more than 10% of the total participation in the activity during the tax year, and the activity is a qualified rental activity.</li>
        <li class="list-item">You participate in the activity for more than 10% of the total participation in the activity during the tax year, and the activity is a trade or business.</li>
        <li class="list-item">You participate in the activity for more than 5% of the total participation in the activity during the tax year, and the activity is a trade or business.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>For more information, see Publication 563.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">Partner's Participation</h3>
        <p>A partner's participation in a partnership activity is generally treated as the participation of the partnership in the activity. The rules in this publication apply to the partnership.</p>
        <p>For more information, see Publication 563.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <h3 class="subsection-title">Limited Partners</h3>
        <p>If you are a limited partner, you generally cannot materially participate in the activity. Your participation is limited to the extent of your capital contribution.</p>
        <p>For more information, see Publication 563.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

