      <h2 class="section-title">Real Estate Professional</h2>
      <p>Generally, rental activities are passive activities. However, if you meet certain requirements, you may be able to treat your rental activities as nonpassive. To qualify as a real estate professional, you must meet all of the following requirements:</p>
